sequenceDiagram
 autonumber
 actor X as Customer Export Officer
 participant View as :UI (Web / Field)
 participant Ctrl as :PlanningEndpoints (planned)
 participant P as :PlanningService
 participant S as :FeasibilitySearch
 participant C as :ComplianceService
 participant Repo as :PlanningPersistence port (planned)
 participant DB as :Database
 X->>View: Request proposal for order/container
 View->>Ctrl: Submit request
 Ctrl->>P: Request proposal for order/container
 P->>+Repo: Read permitted eligible stock and current order specification
 Repo->>+DB: Read permitted eligible stock and current order specification
 DB-->>-Repo: Transaction result
 Repo-->>-P: Result / transaction status
 P->>S: Search stock, owner, quantity, quality and residue constraints
 loop Candidate compositions within documented search budget
 S->>C: Assess candidate with PROPOSE scope
 C-->>S: PASS/FAIL/INCOMPLETE and findings
 end
 S-->>P: Candidate or explicit search outcome/findings
 P->>+Repo: Retain plan version, allocations, proposal assessment and findings
 Repo->>+DB: Retain plan version, allocations, proposal assessment and findings
 DB-->>-Repo: Transaction result
 Repo-->>-P: Result / transaction status
 P-->>Ctrl: Proposal or reasons, no stock withdrawal or approval
 Ctrl-->>View: Operation result and findings
 View-->>X: Display outcome
 Note over DB: Full target design, not a claim of implemented export or residue APIs.
